text:
The dish looks like green spinach-wrapper dumplings with chili oil, on a white plate roughly 22-26 cm across. I count about 5-6 dumplings, each around 25-30 g, which gives roughly 150-180 g of dumplings. The chili oil and garnish add perhaps 15 g.

Total mass is about 180 g. Boiled dumplings run about 1.7 kcal/g, so about 300 kcal for the dumplings, plus about 60 kcal for the oil, giving roughly 330 kcal.

